    '''<p>A building badge should open one finance room, not arrive with a copy of the master key. Data platforms need the same design for S3.</p><p>The platform keeps a named trust object. That object can assume an AWS IAM role. A second object narrows the usable bucket path. Users receive permission on the platform object instead of receiving long-lived AWS access keys.</p>''',
